# Large regenerable intermediates. GitHub rejects any blob over 100 MB and this repo has 20
# such files (~10 GB untracked in total), so a plain `git add -A` would fail outright.
# Everything matched here is rebuilt by the a_*/b_* scripts from the raw inputs.
03_output/3a_eda_output/*.csv
03_output/3a_eda_output/*.dbf
